Description : Help file for PsiFS.


PsiFS is a filing system that provides access via a serial link to files
stored on a SIBO or  EPOC computer. The standard Psion Link Protocol (PLP) is
used; there is no extra software to install or run on the remote machine.

The documentation for PsiFS is provided in HTML format; any installed web
browser may be used to view it. Click MENU over the !PsiFS icon in a filer
window, and select "App. '!PsiFS' > Help" from the menu.

PsiFS is FreeWare; it may be freely used and copied. See the documentation
for more details.
